<title>USA: RJR Nabisco to replace Joe Camel in new ads.</title>
<headline>RJR Nabisco to replace Joe Camel in new ads.</headline>
<dateline>WINSTON-SALEM, N.C. 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Joe Camel is retiring.</p>
<p>The RJ Reynolds Tobacco Co. said Thursday it will replace its controversial animated advertising figure when it rolls out a new ad campaign next week.</p>
</text>
